      "message": "This looks very awkward to me. I suggest adding a method to the `PackageModule` interface so that the install path can be customized.\n\nex:\n\n```\ntype PackageModule interface {\n    ...\n    InstallPathFor(ps *PackaginSpec) OutputPath \n}\n\nfunc CopySpecs(p PackageModule, ... specs map[string]PackagingSpec) ... {\n    ...\n    for _, k :\u003d range SortedKeys(specs) {\n        destPath :\u003d p.InstallDirFor(ps)\n    }\n    ...     \n}\n\nfn (p *PackagingBase) InstallPathFor(ps *PackaginSpec) OutputPath {\n    return filepath.Join(p.rootDir, ps.relPathInPackage)\n}\n\n// overrides the default impl\nfn (f *filesystem) InstallPathFor(ps *PackaginSpec) OutputPath {\n    if ps.Partition() \u003d\u003d \"root\" {\n        return filepath.Join(f.rootDir, ps.relPathInPackage)\n    } else {\n        return filepath.Join(f.baseDir, ps.relPathInPackage)\n    }\n}\n```",
